        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145555,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's the keyword that decides if a code block should run or not?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>when</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145556,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the beginning of the if statement.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game loop tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145557,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the variable that skips the display statement.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"59\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorUnlocked = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hasKey) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You open the treasure door!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>hasKey</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145558,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showHUD = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (showHUD) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;HUD enabled&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>HUD enabled</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nothing</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>HUD enabled</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145559,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assemble the parentheses and insert a condition that runs the code between the curly braces.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn an enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>(</code>, followed by <code>true</code>, and finally <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145560,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which operators can we use to make comparisons for if statement conditions?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code> and <code>&amp;&amp;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">None of them</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145561,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Write a comparison that displays the text if <code>playerHealth</code> is less than or equal to <code>maxHealth</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;maxHealth&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" maxHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth &lt;= maxHealth) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health is within limits&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>playerHealth</code>, followed by <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>maxHealth</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145562,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when we compare two numbers of different values with <code>===</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">We get the boolean <code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">We get the boolean <code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">We get a number</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">We get the boolean <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why should we sometimes store the results of comparisons in variables?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">To reuse the results of the comparisons</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">To always skip a block of code</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">To always run a block of code</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">To reuse the results of the comparisons.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145564,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use a variable that stores the result of a comparison as the if statement's condition.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players &gt; 1\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isMultiplayer = players &gt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isMultiplayer) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Choose characters for each player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>isMultiplayer</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145565,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What do we call the part of an <code>if</code> / <code>else</code> statement that runs when the <code>if</code> statement's condition is <code>false</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">An <code>else</code> statement</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">There is no such conditional</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">An <code>if</code> statement</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">An <code>else</code> statement.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code an empty <code>if</code> statement (has no code block) that checks if <code>gameState</code> equals <code>\"paused\"</code>, followed by an empty <code>else</code> statement.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else (gameState !== &quot;paused)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameState === \" /><text value=\"&quot;paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>if</code> followed by <code>(gameState === \"paused\")</code> and then <code>}</code>, <code>else</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why doesn't the <code>else</code> statement have its own condition between parentheses?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Because its code block will always run if the <code>if</code> condition is not met</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Because it always runs so it doesn't need a condition</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The <code>else</code> statement does have a condition between parentheses</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Because its code block will always run if the <code>if</code> condition is not met.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when <code>enemyCount</code> has a value smaller than 3?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyCount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemyCount &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss fight unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Keep exploring&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>else</code> statement's code block runs</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>if</code> statement's code block runs</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Neither the <code>if</code> code block nor the <code>else</code> statement's code block run</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>else</code> statement's code block runs.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Choose a value for <code>rageMeter</code> so that the <code>else</code> block runs.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rageMeter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Titan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (rageMeter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enrage mode!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + bossName + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not angry enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>79</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 145570,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth === \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You are down!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (playerHealth &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Low health warning.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Low health warning.</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>You are down!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Game over</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Low health warning.</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 145571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the keywords for an <code>else if</code> statement.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"78\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level === \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tutorial started.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level === \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemies get tougher.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>else if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 145572,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"45\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highScore = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score === highScore) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You tied the high score!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt; highScore) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;New high score!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Try again to beat the record!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Try again to beat the record!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>New high score!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>You tied the high score!</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Try again to beat the record!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 145573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Display a message in the console when <code>gameMode</code> isn't equal to <code>\"survival\"</code> or <code>\"hardcore\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"205\" endIndex=\"206\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameMode = \" /><text value=\"&quot;story&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameMode === \" /><text value=\"&quot;survival&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No checkpoints.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameMode === \" /><text value=\"&quot;hardcore&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;One life only.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Checkpoints enabled.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>else</code>, followed by <code>{</code>, and finally <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #20",
            "id": 145574,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when the <code>if</code> statement and <code>else if</code> statements' conditions return <code>false</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (ammo &gt; \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &amp;&amp; ammo &lt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ammo is almost full&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (ammo &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ammo is full&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nothing displays in the console</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Ammo is almost full</code> displays in the console</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Ammo is full</code> displays in the console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nothing displays in the console.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
